@host = http://localhost:4200

### Has this browser logged today? (issues the mt_pid cookie on first call)
GET {{host}}/api/moods/today
Accept: application/json

### Log today's mood (201 first time, 409 the second time on the same cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/moods
Content-Type: application/json

{ "rating": 3, "comment": "Release went out clean this morning." }

### Admin sign-in (sets the mt_admin ticket cookie)
POST {{host}}/api/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "change-me-locally" }

### Admin list, newest first
GET {{host}}/api/admin/moods?page=1&pageSize=50
Accept: application/json
